#===============================================================================
#  ARDHANARISHVARA OS — ENGINEERING SUPPORT DOCUMENT
#  SovereignOS System Services Engine
#  File: system_services_engine.support
#===============================================================================
#  PURPOSE:
#    Engineering reference for the SovereignOS system services engine responsible for:
#      • daemon lifecycle management
#      • dependency graph resolution
#      • async service execution
#      • IPC-based service invocation
#      • service health tracking
#
#===============================================================================
#  MODULE SUMMARY:
#
#    - [Service Registration](ca://s?q=Explain_Service_Registration)
#    - [Dependency Graph](ca://s?q=Explain_Dependency_Graph)
#    - [Daemon Lifecycle](ca://s?q=Explain_Daemon_Lifecycle)
#    - [Service IPC](ca://s?q=Explain_Service_IPC)
#    - [Service Health](ca://s?q=Explain_Service_Health)
#
#===============================================================================
#  FUNCTION OVERVIEW:
#
#    - register(name, handler, deps)
#         Registers a system service.
#
#    - start(name)
#         Starts service + dependencies.
#
#    - stop(name)
#         Stops a running service.
#
#    - resolve(name)
#         Computes dependency chain.
#
#    - register_ipc(channel, handler)
#         Registers IPC channel.
#
#    - ipc(channel, payload)
#         Sends IPC message.
#
#    - snapshot()
#         Returns full system services state.
#
#===============================================================================
#  SERVICE STRUCTURE FORMAT:
#
#    {
#      "name": "network.daemon",
#      "handler": <async callable>,
#      "dependencies": ["core.init"],
#      "running": true/false,
#      "last_start": <epoch>,
#      "health": "running"
#    }
#
#===============================================================================
#  RELATED MODULES:
#
